      "content": "\u003cdiv class\u003d\"step_content\"\u003e\n \u003cp\u003ePress \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_19499\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qlist.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_19499\u0026quot;,175)\"\u003e and enter the numbers 1 through 17 for L\u003csub\u003e1\u003c/sub\u003e. Key in \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_19500\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q1.gif\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_19501\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qenter.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_19501\u0026quot;,144)\"\u003e, \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_19502\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/q2.gif\"\u003e \u003cimg id\u003d\"token_19503\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\" src\u003d\"/specialchars/qenter.gif\" onmouseout\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOut()\" onmouseover\u003d\"return parent.doMouseOver(\u0026quot;token_19503\u0026quot;,144)\"\u003e, etc.\u003c/p\u003e\n \u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/div\u003e\u003cimg class\u003d\"graphimgstatic id\u003d\" figure-1 src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_8_1_realnumbersandthepythagoreantheorem_3b_70/f-70-3b-1.gif\"\u003e\n\u003cbr\u003e",
